        "CopyrightInformation": "©2017 American Association for Cancer Research.",
        "AbstractText": "Poziotinib, an EGFR inhibitor that was previously shelved as ineffective against non-small cell lung cancer, is showing promising activity in a subset of patients with EGFR exon 20 insertions. According to preliminary data from a phase II trial, the drug led to a 73% overall response rate in patients with this disease subtype, which is typically highly resistant to standard therapy."
      },
